#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "84_Kiryu"
msgid "Your scheme's finished, for good. Give up and get the hell out of town."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "96_Rouge"
msgid "What choice do I have now?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "108_Kiryu"
msgid "But before you go, you're going to tell me a little more about the Dark Clan."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "120_Rouge"
msgid "What do you want to know?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "132_Kiryu"
msgid "Where's the strongest group in your alliance located?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "144_Rouge"
msgid "What do you plan to do with that information?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "156_Kiryu"
msgid "I want to know what's coming next."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "168_Rouge"
msgid "Are you sure that's all?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "180_Kiryu"
msgid "I've got enough people after me in Kamurocho already. I'm not interested in going head to head with any more groups, gangs, or syndicates."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "192_Rouge"
msgid "Hahaha. In other words, discretion is the better part of valor? So that's also a part of being the Legendary Yakuza..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "204_Rouge"
msgid "However, if that's why you want to know, I'm afraid I can't give you an answer."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "216_Rouge"
msgid "It would give you an unfair advantage the next time we make an attempt on your life."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "228_Rouge"
msgid "Now then, if you'll excuse me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "300_Akaishi"
msgid "Interesting..."
msgstr "Interesante..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "312_Akaishi"
msgid "So, you beat them this time, but they may come looking for you again?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "324_Akaishi"
msgid "Is that really what you wanted, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "336_Kiryu"
msgid "I don't think we'll need to deal with them again anytime soon."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "348_Kiryu"
msgid "I'll probably be back in Okinawa the next time they try to take me down, so I'm not going to worry about it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "360_Akaishi"
msgid "Hmm, interesting. So, it's not necessary to wipe them out completely? Is this some kind of \"live and let live\" philosophy of the underworld?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "372_Kiryu"
msgid "Well, wading through all those gang conflicts, I got the sense that all groups are capable of making a change for the better."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "384_Kiryu"
msgid "It's not impossible, you know. Even for a group that sets out to crush the yakuza, but ends up a lot like the yakuza themselves."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "396_Kiryu"
msgid "As long as they keep coming after me, I'll keep standing my ground."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "408_Kiryu"
msgid "There've been plenty of guys who picked a fight with me only to come out of it a better man."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "420_Akaishi"
msgid "I see what you mean. You know, you really do live up to the title of fourth chairman. You're a better man than I'll ever be."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "432_Kiryu"
msgid "Huh? You already knew about me?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "444_Akaishi"
msgid "Haha, doesn't everybody know about you? You're famous. Or infamous, depending on whom you ask."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "456_Akaishi"
msgid "Anyone in this town who hasn't heard of Kazuma Kiryu must have been living under a rock!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "468_Akaishi"
msgid "Oh, I almost forgot to tell you! The gang violence seems to have died down."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "480_Akaishi"
msgid "Apparently, the mafia has been putting a lot of pressure on the gangs."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "492_Kiryu"
msgid "The mafia?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "504_Akaishi"
msgid "That's right. From the mafia's point of view, there's not much to gain from stirring up any more trouble."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "516_Kiryu"
msgid "Guess that's how it goes. Yakuza, mafia... No shortage of thugs out there."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "528_Akaishi"
msgid "So it would seem. Thanks for your hard work."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "540_Akaishi"
msgid "I'm sure there are a few stragglers out there who haven't had their fill of violence yet, so please don't let your guard down."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "552_Akaishi"
msgid "Also, this is our final gift to you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "576_Akaishi"
msgid "I'll be waiting in front of the theater, as always. If you get any proof of driving more gang members out of town, bring it to me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "648_Kiryu"
msgid "So I get to meet you at last. You're the boss of the Dark Clan?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "660_Man"
msgid "Yes, at the moment. I'm known as Rouge."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "672_Kiryu"
msgid "At the moment? What the hell does that mean?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "684_Rouge"
msgid "When the Dark Clan of Yakuza Extermination takes on a job, the person executing the hit takes control."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "696_Rouge"
msgid "This \"boss\" is given complete authority until the hit is executed, or he perishes. Those are the rules under which we operate."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "708_Rouge"
msgid "So, in short, I'm the current Dark Clan leader for the matter at hand."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "720_Kiryu"
msgid "I see. Just what kind of members belong to this little syndicate of yours?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "732_Rouge"
msgid "Well, you could say it's mostly those not too fond of the yakuza, but the majority are foreigners."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "744_Kiryu"
msgid "A foreign mafia?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "756_Rouge"
msgid "Not all of them. Some simply have reason to bear a grudge against yakuza. But many are mafia members from all across Asia."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "768_Kiryu"
msgid "I see. But then, why are you all trying to eliminate me? I'm no longer with the yakuza."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "780_Rouge"
msgid "Since either you or I must die to end this, I suppose we might as well talk."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "792_Rouge"
msgid "Your mere presence threatens to disrupt the delicate balance within the underworld. We've been well aware of that for some time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "804_Rouge"
msgid "Controlling you to make the yakuza move as we see fit would be the optimal scenario."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "816_Rouge"
msgid "But as that doesn't seem to be possible, the decision was made to eliminate you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "828_Kiryu"
msgid "Why did you just decide this now?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "840_Rouge"
msgid "The death of Lau Ka Long of the Snake Flower Triad was the main reason."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "852_Rouge"
msgid "Until then, we'd simply regarded you with caution. But Lau's death came as a huge shock to us."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "864_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "876_Rouge"
msgid "Of course, we're aware it wasn't you who killed him."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "888_Rouge"
msgid "However, his death changed the balance of power among the Asian mafia here in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "900_Rouge"
msgid "Not only are you yakuza, you shattered the power balance in Kamurocho with one fell swoop."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "912_Rouge"
msgid "For those like us who try to control the city from the shadows, it was quite unsettling."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "924_Rouge"
msgid "You probably can't even imagine how threatened we felt at the prospect of you wiping out everything we struggled to accomplish."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "936_Rouge"
msgid "It is true you're not pulling the strings in the underworld anymore. You've settled down in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "948_Rouge"
msgid "But you're like a natural disaster that takes the city by storm every so often."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "960_Kiryu"
msgid "So why go to the trouble of getting involved in that mess with the gangs?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "972_Rouge"
msgid "Just when we were trying to figure out what to do, a rather strange war broke out between the gangs vying for your head."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "984_Rouge"
msgid "Normally, we'd ignore such juvenile antics. However, we just couldn't bear to let a golden opportunity go to waste."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "996_Kiryu"
msgid "Okay, now that I know the why, let me ask you one more thing."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1008_Rouge"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "¿Mmm?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1020_Kiryu"
msgid "Aren't you guys just a bunch of criminals, too?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1032_Rouge"
msgid "What do you mean by that?"
msgstr "¿Qué quieres decir?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1044_Kiryu"
msgid "You can make a big deal about yakuza and call me a disaster or whatever, but in the end you're just the same."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1056_Kiryu"
msgid "The same goes with you targeting me. You can go on about your high and mighty cause, but it all comes down to a simple power struggle."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1068_Kiryu"
msgid "So cut the crap, and bring it on!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1080_Rouge"
msgid "Well, now that it's all out in the open, it's time for me to eliminate Kazuma Kiryu, the man who dares to challenge our mighty syndicate!"
msgstr ""
